<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112490" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύζ-α</span></b>  (not <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῦζα</span></b> , Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
			1.251
		</span></i>), ἡ, expld. as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ
			μετὰ δειλίας φυγή</span> by <i><span class="en">
			Aristarch.
		</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
			Apollon.
			<u>Lex.</u>
		</span></i>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φόβος</span>
			:—<i>headlong flight, rout,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύζα, φόβον κρυόεντος ἑταίρη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					9.2
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				14.140
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνάλκιδα φύζαν ἐνόρσας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					15.62
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θάνατον καὶ φ. ἑταίρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					17.381
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν δὲ Ζεὺς . . φύζαν ἐμοῖς ἑτάροισι
					κακὴν βάλεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					14.269
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
